.md
## AnimatedImage or how to export animation
Applying `AnimatedImage` on `Animate`, `AnimatePlot` or `AnimateParametericPlot` will automatically render all frames offscreen and return `AniamtedImage` object containing all uncompressed frames

%-------------------------------------------------------------------------%
Display: markdown
Type: Output
%-------------------------------------------------------------------------%
## AnimatedImage or how to export animation
Applying `AnimatedImage` on `Animate`, `AnimatePlot` or `AnimateParametericPlot` will automatically render all frames offscreen and return `AniamtedImage` object containing all uncompressed frames

%-------------------------------------------------------------------------%
Type: Input
%-------------------------------------------------------------------------%
animation = Animate[
  ParametricPlot[ReIm[(*SpB[*)Power[I(*|*),(*|*)-t](*]SpB*) + 3 (*SpB[*)Power[I(*|*),(*|*)t/3](*]SpB*)], {t,0,u}, 
    Epilog->{
      Arrow[{{0,0}, ReIm[(*SpB[*)Power[I(*|*),(*|*)-u](*]SpB*)]}], 
      Arrow[{ ReIm[(*SpB[*)Power[I(*|*),(*|*)-u](*]SpB*)], ReIm[(*SpB[*)Power[I(*|*),(*|*)-u](*]SpB*) + 3 (*SpB[*)Power[I(*|*),(*|*)u/3](*]SpB*)]}]
    }, PlotRange->{{-4,4}, {-4,4}}, GridLines->Automatic,
    PlotStyle->(*VB[*)(RGBColor[1, 0, 0])(*,*)(*"1:eJxTTMoPSmNiYGAo5gUSYZmp5S6pyflFiSX5RcEsQBHn4PCQNGaQPAeQCHJ3cs7PyS8qYgCDD/ZQBgMDnAEA4iUPRg=="*)(*]VB*)
  ]
, {u, 0.001, 4Pi}, RefreshRate->30, Appearance->None];

ai = AnimatedImage[animation, FrameRate->30];
ai

%-------------------------------------------------------------------------%
Type: Output
%-------------------------------------------------------------------------%
(*VB[*)(CoffeeLiqueur`Extensions`Video`Internal`imgSymbol$362558)(*,*)(*"1:eJxTTMoPSmNkYGAoZgESHvk5KRCeEJBwK8rPK3HNS3GtSE0uLUlMykkNVgEKW5gbJ6caW5jpJqeYJuuamBmn6CYaJBnrWliYpqQYmBkbmSWaAwCEHhV6"*)(*]VB*)

%-------------------------------------------------------------------------%
