.md
If you prefer to do it in a non-blocking way (asynchronously), set `Asynchronous->True`, `AnimatedImage` will return `Promise`: 

%-------------------------------------------------------------------------%
Display: markdown
Type: Output
%-------------------------------------------------------------------------%
If you prefer to do it in a non-blocking way (asynchronously), set `Asynchronous->True`, `AnimatedImage` will return `Promise`: 

%-------------------------------------------------------------------------%
Type: Input
%-------------------------------------------------------------------------%
Then[AnimatedImage[animation, Asynchronous->True], Function[result,
  ai = result;
  Beep[];
]];

